  "motivation": {
    "staticGap": "selectSfScenarioCandidates is already a private whole-decisionResults read-set. In S20 the Provider selects that collection only after the native child has copied the broader product state. The fixed native transport has no decisionResults tag.",
    "mechanism": "Extend the existing finite selection union, private Provider query/predispatch and LocalStore map-retention decision. SourcePersistence and CurrentChoice transport the tag through their existing exact-work protocol.",
    "benefitBoundary": "Avoid deep cloning known unselected map contents in eligible native child copies when those contents are not reachable from retained data. All whole-collection reads, filters, clone isolation and live authority checks remain. There is no measured C21 latency benefit yet."
  },
  "protocol": [
    "The registered scenario-candidate callback is unchanged. Factory registration and native selection do not read request.caseRef, IDs, collection entries or the predicate.",
    "Only namespace cases with the scenarioReads private mark and no earlier/conflicting read classes can request decisionResults. The namespace, cases authorization and reported cases storageVersion are unchanged.",
    "The Provider's C08 body remains the query owner. Source places its own closed execute callback in dashboardProductRead.work; CurrentChoice's unscoped/no-authorizeCommit branch forwards exactly that callback/options. LocalStore compares that exact callback before projecting.",
    "LocalStore preserves all existing shallow envelope/map validation. Its existing additive loop already proves a present non-undefined decisionResults value plain; the new guard rejects undefined without a redundant second getPrototypeOf call.",
    "The entire decisionResults collection is retained in the existing native clone(view), with ACL, top-level metadata, sfSources/audit and unknown product fields. Known other maps are reduced only under the existing read-set contract. This is not universal full-state clone equivalence.",
    "The Provider revalidates the actual materialized tag, current authority/persistence/driver and callback precedence. A tagged decisionResults result must still have its private scenario route and a valid collection; it cannot reach the opaque callback branch.",
    "The existing scenarioSelection.project(structuredClone(scenarioResults), authority), binding guard, Object.values/filter predicate, abort branch, second authorize, final rechecks and return metadata are literal.",
    "Missing/own-undefined/nonplain collections, legacy/invalid envelope, uncertain codec/pins, opaque authorizer/context/callback, wrong namespace, precedence conflicts and CurrentChoice's wrapped callback keep the prior fallback. Late drift refuses delivery; no replay or alternate authority path is added.",
    "Fresh detached graphs, reachable alias/cycle semantics and complete-collection clone failures remain governed by the original clones. The change adds no result/grant cache, native result sharing, new await, production observer or timeout."
  ],
